            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, electricity, evocation)\n\nThe desert drake spits a ball of electrically charged sand to a range of 60 feet that explodes into a cloud with a 15-foot-radius burst. Creatures in the area take 9d6 electricity damage (27 basic Reflex save). The cloud remains for 1d4 rounds, granting concealment to everything within. The desert drake can't use Sandstorm Breath again for 1d6 rounds."
